message: >-
  If you use TakaBooks in research, teaching, a compliance workflow or a
  derived tool, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: software
title: "TakaBooks — টাকাবুকস"
abstract: >-
  TakaBooks is an LLM-agnostic bookkeeping and taxation package for Bangladesh.
  It ships cited, versioned reference material on income tax, VAT (মূসক),
  withholding tax (TDS / উৎসে কর কর্তন, VDS), statutory bookkeeping, payroll and
  the compliance calendar, together with a dependency-free Python engine that
  keeps double-entry books in integer paisa and computes every figure
  deterministically from a per-assessment-year rates file in which each value
  carries a source URL and a verification flag. Bundles are built for Claude,
  ChatGPT, Gemini, AGENTS.md-aware coding agents and any other LLM. It is not
  professional advice; figures must be verified with a licensed Income Tax
  Practitioner or Chartered Accountant before filing.
version: "1.2.0"
